# battery-swap-ops API collection (P0-4) — for VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client
# Prereq: server up at :8400 with dev profile; secrets in .local/ (gitignored).
# Note: device channel requires HMAC request signing; use scripts/verify/batch15/_py_contract_client.py
#       for a language-independent, signed example (heartbeat / event).

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8400/api
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
@adminToken = 00000000000000000000000000000000

### health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### rider login (dev phone)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "13800000001"}

### rider: stations (inventory view)
GET {{base}}/user/stations
X-User-Token: {{token}}

### rider: wallet (balance / deposit / active plan)
GET {{base}}/user/wallet
X-User-Token: {{token}}

### rider: create SWAP order (Idempotency-Key mandatory)
# @name createOrder
POST {{base}}/user/order
X-User-Token: {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "SWAP"}

### rider: order status
GET {{base}}/user/order/{{createOrder.response.body.$.data.orderNo}}
X-User-Token: {{token}}

### sim: battery out (simulate device event; replace cabinetNo/cellNo from order status)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8500/sim/battery/out?cabinetNo=SWAP-C-001&cellNo=1

### sim: battery in (return battery with soc)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8500/sim/battery/in?cabinetNo=SWAP-C-001&cellNo=1&batteryNo=BAT-0000&soc=10

### admin (break-glass static token from .local/admin-token.txt)
POST {{base}}/admin/reconcile/run
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### admin: last reconciliation report
GET {{base}}/admin/reconcile/last
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### OpenAPI spec / Swagger UI
GET {{base}}/v3/api-docs
###
GET {{base}}/swagger-ui.html
